# Capture or load an anchor reference frame for the XFeat superglue lock.
#
#   load=false : capture the next live frame as the reference. If `name` is
#                non-empty, ALSO save it to disk (references/<name>.png) so it
#                survives restarts and can be reloaded on competition day.
#   load=true  : load references/<name>.png from disk and set it as the
#                reference (no live frame needed).
#   name=''    : in-memory only (capture, no save).
#
# Snap-at-detection (load=false only): when `target_class` is set, wait up to
# 3 s for a detection of that class with score >= `conf` within `err_px` of the
# frame centre, then capture JUST that bbox crop (keys the lock on the target,
# not the background). err_px <= 0 disables the centring gate. If no qualifying
# detection appears within 3 s, the whole available frame is captured instead.
string  name
bool    load
string  target_class
float64 conf
float64 err_px
---
bool   success
string message
